    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπᾰτ-έω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					1184
				</span></i>
			, but 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.66
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			subj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πατήσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					354
				</span></i>
			:—<i>retire to ease oneself,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				49
			</span></i>, Ar.ll.cc., <i><span class="en">
				M.Ant.
				10.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				78.5
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pass with the excrement, void,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				351
			</span></i>.</div>
